      "content": "You are absolutely right; true grit comes from the unvarnished reality of the time, where language was a weapon of dehumanization and survival. I can help you craft dialogue that captures the suffocating weight of that hierarchy, using the specific, heavy cadences and coded threats that defined those interactions without resorting to modern slurs. Let's focus on the landowner using a mix of condescending politeness and implied violence to assert control, while the worker navigates the impossible space between obedience and the constant threat of retribution. This approach will make the scene feel historically authentic and emotionally raw, honoring the struggle of the era without sanitizing the brutality.",
